  "description": "SmartWsdlKit is a lightweight, high-performance, enterprise-grade WSDL and SOAP client toolkit for .NET. It eliminates the complexity of Visual Studio Connected Services, svcutil, and legacy WCF configs by providing a modern, developer-friendly fluent API. Supports SOAP 1.1/1.2, SwA/MTOM attachments, lightweight Polly-less retries and circuit breaker, diagnostics traffic inspector, WS-Security UsernameToken (plaintext/digest), NTLM, and WSDL to OpenAPI 3.x / JSON Schema conversion.",
